## PROJECT SPECIFICATION

Build a production-ready financial analysis system following 12-Factor Agents principles:
- 90% deterministic Python code, 10% micro-LLM calls
- Each LLM call = max 50 tokens input, max 10 tokens output
- NO monolithic agents, only micro-functions
- State in databases, not in memory
- Every number traceable to source PDF page

